Package: termux-xwayland-bridge
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Termux-XWayland contributors
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: bash, coreutils, socat
Description: Termux-side Binder session client for Termux-XWayland
 A small Termux package that manages Weston lifecycle and starts an app_process
 Binder client under the existing Termux UID. The Binder heartbeat is not a
 real desktop frame stream; compositor rendering and input routing remain pending.
